WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome back. In this lesson we're going to talk about market awareness.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Eugene Schwartz described five levels of awareness in Breakthrough Advertising.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The first level is unaware: they don't even know they have a problem.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Then problem aware: they feel the pain, but don't know the solutions.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Solution aware: they know solutions exist, but not your product.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Product aware: they know your product, but they aren't convinced yet.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
And most aware: they just need the right offer to buy today.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Your hook has to match the awareness level of the avatar you're targeting.
